    {
      "id": 132,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "入库 TPS（当前）",
      "description": "最近 1 分钟平均的入库速率。\n\n**口径**：入库 TPS 指真正写进 InfluxDB 的条数，不是接入量。过载时 EMQX 会先向设备 PUBACK 再丢弃，**对外承诺能力只能用入库 TPS**。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "conduit-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(conduit_pipeline_processed_total{type=\"property\"}[1m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "conduit-prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
