    {
      "id": 135,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "端到端延迟 P50 / P99",
      "description": "从 transport 收到消息到写入时序库并更新最新值的耗时，即「数据多久能查到」。\n只统计实时消费，不含遥测重放（重放处理旧数据会污染百分位）。\n**时钟来源**：receivedAt 取自 transport 进程时钟，计时在 server 进程；当前两者同宿主机，分机部署后该值会带上时钟差。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "conduit-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(conduit_pipeline_ingest_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "P50",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "conduit-prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(conduit_pipeline_ingest_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "P99",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "conduit-prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
